92
00:10:41,683 --> 00:10:44,810
Rule one. No touching at work.

93
00:10:44,811 --> 00:10:46,104
1. NO TOUCHING AT WORK

94
00:10:49,190 --> 00:10:53,111
And definitely no standing close
